From 759de2126535200b32e236cf18cf35efa498ba30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:00:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 34 (FORK-20, part 1): world.set-menu-text and the text
 widget's text_data

A block entity's menu carries up to 64 strings (set-menu-text, kept in its saved compound). The host sends them on horizon:menu_text to the clients within 16 blocks when they change and to the player that opens the menu; a screen's text widget with text_data n shows string n.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
